{"ref":"BDB, חָרִם","hw":"חָרִם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרִם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>consecrated;</em> cf. Sab. n.pr.m. <span dir=\"rtl\">חרם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יחרמאל</span> Hal<sup>411. 504</sup> DHM<sup>l.c.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  priest of the third course, David’s time, according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.8\">1 Ch 24:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  priest of time of Nehemiah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.6\">Ne 10:6</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  heads of families of returning exiles: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:39\" href=\"/Ezra.2.39\">Ezr 2:39</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.41\">Ne 7:42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:21\" href=\"/Ezra.10.21\">Ezr 10:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.15\">Ne 12:15</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:32\" href=\"/Ezra.2.32\">Ezr 2:32</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.34\">Ne 7:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" href=\"/Ezra.10.31\">Ezr 10:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.11\">Ne 3:11</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a prince <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.28\">Ne 10:28</a>.","next":"BDB, חָרְמָה","prev":"BDB, חֳרֵם"}